  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Ying Wu Xie’s body self-detonates over the Yi Tian Mountain battlefield and becomes a dream realm of rainbow light. The realm expands until Fang Yuan must keep retreating, then stops, filling his vision. Under that cover, some Gu Immortals’ immortal apertures might remain on the field, and life and death blessed land is still around, so Fang Yuan cannot reach them without unraveling a dream of that size.",
      "chapters": [
        1023
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_ying_wu_xie",
        "loc_yi_tian_mountain",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Ying Wu Xie’s body turns into layers of dazzling rainbow-colored lights that form an external dream realm, unfathomably deep.",
      "chapters": [
        1023
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Later a huge illusory light lump shines in many colors, dazzling and bright, as the giant dream realm over the ruined Yi Tian Mountain battlefield.",
      "chapters": [
        1111
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spectral Soul Demon Venerable’s main body has already fallen deep into the dream realm.",
      "chapters": [
        1027
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "spectral-soul-trapped-inside",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_spectral_soul_demon_venerable"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan later notes that Spectral Soul is trapped there and is being weakened continuously, so drawing food path methods from him is too hard for the moment.",
      "chapters": [
        1093
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "spectral-soul-trapped-inside",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heavenly Court likewise names Spectral Soul as trapped inside the giant dream realm after the battle of Yi Tian Mountain.",
      "chapters": [
        1234
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "spectral-soul-trapped-inside",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_heavenly_court"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Ying Wu Xie and the remnant Shadow Sect force treat breaking the Southern Border encirclement around the giant dream realm as the route to save him.",
      "chapters": [
        1044
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "southern-border-encirclement",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_shadow_sect",
        "reg_southern_border"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Shang clan Gu Immortals say Yi Tian Mountain has been covered by the giant dream realm, and that Southern Border righteous path forces are joining to blockade the place, research it, and keep demonic path and lone immortals out.",
      "chapters": [
        1072
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "southern-border-encirclement",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_shang_clan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan states that Shadow Sect’s blessed land at Yi Tian Mountain, with the Door of Life and Death inside it, is engulfed by that giant dream realm, and that the realm is the greatest obstacle to reaching the door.",
      "chapters": [
        1092
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "southern-border-encirclement",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_shadow_sect_blessed_land",
        "loc_door_of_life_and_death"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Southern Border righteous path super forces later finish a super Gu formation around the multicolored giant dream realm so they can control it jointly and keep outsiders from claiming its benefits. Wu clan and Luo tribe both claim large Immortal Gu contributions toward that formation, while Chi Qu You is named as the main person in charge of setting it up.",
      "chapters": [
        1111
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "formation-finished-credit-claimed",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_super_gu_formation",
        "fac_wu_clan",
        "fac_luo_tribe",
        "sys_immortal_gu",
        "char_chi_qu_you"
      ]
    }
